      55.29,
      351.28,
      106.96,
      364.61
    ],
    "text": "Instructions",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      377.47,
      549.82,
      442.61
    ],
    "text": "01. On behalf of the Registering Officer of each district, it is hereby notified that the Registering Officers mentioned in the Column II of the Schedule below for the electoral districts mentioned in the corresponding Column I of the said Schedule have notified on 09.04.2024 that the preparation of Lists \u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d has been completed and that the said lists or parts thereof are placed at the aforementioned exhibition centers for inspection by the public during office hours, as per Section 13 of the Registration of Electors Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      455.47,
      549.83,
      559.61
    ],
    "text": "02. Every person who is qualified in terms of Section 14 of the Registration of Electors Act to have his own name or someone else\u2019s name entered in the said electoral register appIicable to each electoral district and whose name has been omitted from the electoral register and from List \u201cB\u201d or whose name has been included in List \u201cA\u201d may claim by himself or by someone else on his behalf, as the case may be. substantially in form \u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d set out in the Schedule to above Registration of Electors Act to have his or someone else\u2019s name entered or retained in the register, and submit it to reach the registering officer of each electoral district on or before May 06, 2024, within 4 weeks from the date of the publication of this notice in the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka i.e. from April 09. 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      572.47,
      549.85,
      663.61
    ],
    "text": "03. Any person whose name appears in the electoral register or in list \u201cB\u201d for any electoral district may object to the entry of his own name or to the entry or retention of the name of any other person appearing in such register or list \u201cB\u201d. Every such objection shall be made in duplicate and shall be substantially in form \u201cC\u201d set out in the schedule to the above Act and shall be made so as to reach the registering officer of the Election Office. All objections to the inclusion of the name in the register should be sent to the registering officer of the District Elections Office on or before May 06. 2024, within 4 weeks from the date of the publication of this notice in the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka i.e. from April 09, 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      676.47,
      549.8,
      741.61
    ],
    "text": "04. Every objection to the entry of the name of any claimant in the electoral register shall be made in duplicate and shall be substantially in form \u201cD\u201d set out in the schedule to the above Act and shall be made so as to reach the registering officer within 14 days from the date on which the notice containing the name of claimants is exhibited at the District Election Office. This notice will be published in the District Election Offices on April 25, 2024 and May 09, 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
